  (text "built-in DevKit" (at 127 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8352281f-5d8c-4e89-8b89-3b4a374ffcaf)
  )
  (text "Note: The UART mappings are exchanged in comparison to upstream:\n\n* the original did the swapping during the final mapping to the IC\n* this one does it as part of the logic level shifters\n\nThus:\n\n* `GPIO17` (UART2TX) is mapped to the `DESK_4` (RX) port (upstream: `16` -> `DESK_4`)\n* `GPIO16` (UART2RX) is mapped to the `DESK_2` (TX) port (upstream: `17` -> `DESK_2`)"
    (at 20.32 99.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e2e85fbf-1cf8-413e-9e8b-bb7276a98505)
  )

